<title>USA: First American Bank  president resigns.</title>
<headline>First American Bank  president resigns.</headline>
<dateline>ROSEMEAD, Calif. 1997-03-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>First American Bank in Rosemead, Calif., said Monday Robert Zingg has resigned as president and chief operating officer.</p>
<p>No replacement was named.</p>
<p>First American reported a loss for its fourth quarter of $8.36 million compared with a net loss of $301,000 in the year-ago period.</p>
